OL,14,     Fregion of Asturias on Spain's
OL,15,     Fnorth coast, winding through
OL,16,     Fmountains to a traditional fiesta,
OL,17,     Fexploring the capital Oviedo, and
OL,18,     Fsampling cloudy cider. (Ep2)
